{
  "name": "mach-glfw",
  "description": "Ziggified bindings for GLFW v3.3+, providing 100% API coverage with a focus on type safety and idiomatic Zig patterns. It features zero-dependency cross-compilation support, wrapping C pointers in slices, and replacing bitmasks with packed structs and enums. The library includes a custom build system for managing upstream GLFW sources across Windows (Win32), macOS (Cocoa), and Linux (X11/Wayland).",
